*References:* A. Abragam, *The Principles of Nuclear Magnetism* (Oxford Univ. Press, 1961) · M. H. Levitt, *Spin Dynamics: Basics of Nuclear Magnetic Resonance* (Wiley) · L. G. Hanson, "Is quantum mechanics necessary for understanding magnetic resonance?", *Concepts Magn. Reson. A* 32, 329–340 (2008) · J. H. Ardenkjær-Larsen et al., "Increase in signal-to-noise ratio of > 10,000 times in liquid-state NMR", *PNAS* 100, 10158–10163 (2003) · D. G. Nishimura, *Principles of Magnetic Resonance Imaging* (Stanford).
